              "key": "enabled",
              "type": {
                "kind": "boolean",
                "capability": {
                  "sources": [
                    "jar-schema",
                    "jar-default"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "This option requires a restart to work. The only thing that this option is going to do is optimizing the amount of data being saved. Ranks have a lot of data and it helps the IO operation a lot of they're not saved. When the plugin wants to load data, first it checks if that option is enabled. If it's disabled it'll just copy the default ranks from this file Then when the plugin wants to save data, it checks the option again and if it's disabled, it'll not write the rank settings to the json file. It doesn't matter what you changed in your rank settings. You can keep them as long as your kingdom didn't go through a cache cycle, but after that it'll go back to defaults below.",
